  "title": "BioHarvest Sciences to Present at the Canaccord Genuity 46th Annual Growth Conference",
  "summary": "Vancouver, British Columbia and Rehovot, Israel – July 29, 2026 – BioHarvest Sciences Inc (NASDAQ: BHST) (FSE: 8MV0), a leader in Botanical Synthesis technology and sustainable plant-based molecule development, today announced that its Chief Executive Officer, Zaki Rakib, will present at the upcoming Canaccord Genuity 46th Annual Growth Conference, to be held on August 11-13, 2026,",
